{"id":"torrey:judah-the-tribe-of","source":"torrey","name":"Judah, The Tribe Of","slug":"judah-the-tribe-of","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Descended from Jacob’s fourth son — Ge 29:35.","refs":[["Gen",29,35,29,35]]},{"text":"Predictions respecting — Ge 49:8-12; De 33:7.","refs":[["Gen",49,8,49,12],["Deut",33,7,33,7]]},{"text":"To number the people. — Nu 1:7.","refs":[["Num",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"To spy out the land. — Nu 13:6.","refs":[["Num",13,6,13,6]]},{"text":"To divide the land. — Nu 34:19.","refs":[["Num",34,19,34,19]]},{"text":"Strength of, on leaving Egypt — Nu 1:26,27; 2:4.","refs":[["Num",1,26,1,26],["Num",1,27,1,27],["Num",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"Encamped with its standard east of the tabernacle — Nu 2:3.","refs":[["Num",2,3,2,3]]},{"text":"Led the first division of Israel in their journeys — Nu 10:14.","refs":[["Num",10,14,10,14]]},{"text":"Offering of, at dedication — Nu 7:12-17.","refs":[["Num",7,12,7,17]]},{"text":"Families of — Nu 26:19-21.","refs":[["Num",26,19,26,21]]},{"text":"Strength of on entering Canaan — Nu 26:22.","refs":[["Num",26,22,26,22]]},{"text":"On Gerizim said amen to the blessings — De 27:12.","refs":[["Deut",27,12,27,12]]},{"text":"Bounds of inheritance — Jos 15:1-12.","refs":[["Josh",15,1,15,12]]},{"text":"First and most vigorous in driving out the Canaanites — Jdj 1:3-20.","refs":[["Judg",1,3,1,20]]},{"text":"Went first against Gibeah — Jdj 20:18.","refs":[["Judg",20,18,20,18]]},{"text":"Furnished to Israel the first judge — Jdj 3:9.","refs":[["Judg",3,9,3,9]]},{"text":"Aided Saul in his wars — 1Sa 11:8; 15:4.","refs":[["1Sam",11,8,11,8],["1Sam",15,4,15,4]]},{"text":"After Saul’s rebellion appointed to furnish kings to Israel — 1Sa 13:14; 15:28; 16:6,13; 2Sa 2:4; 7:16,17.","refs":[["1Sam",13,14,13,14],["1Sam",15,28,15,28],["1Sam",16,6,16,6],["1Sam",16,13,16,13],["2Sam",2,4,2,4],["2Sam",7,16,7,16],["2Sam",7,17,7,17]]},{"text":"The first to submit to David — 2Sa 2:10.","refs":[["2Sam",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"Reigned over alone by David seven years and a half — 2Sa 2:11; 5:5.","refs":[["2Sam",2,11,2,11],["2Sam",5,5,5,5]]},{"text":"Officer placed over by David — 1Ch 27:18.","refs":[["1Chr",27,18,27,18]]},{"text":"Reproved for tardiness in bringing back David after Absalom’s rebellion — 2Sa 19:11-15.","refs":[["2Sam",19,11,19,15]]},{"text":"Other tribes jealous of, on account of David — 2Sa 19:41-42; 20:1,2.","refs":[["2Sam",19,41,19,42],["2Sam",20,1,20,1],["2Sam",20,2,20,2]]},{"text":"With Benjamin alone, adhered to the house of David — 1Ki 12:21.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,21,12,21]]},{"text":"The last tribe carried into captivity — 2Ki 17:18,20; 25:21.","refs":[["2Kgs",17,18,17,18],["2Kgs",17,20,17,20],["2Kgs",25,21,25,21]]},{"text":"Out Lord sprang from — Mt 1:3-16; Lu 3:23-33; Heb 7:14.","refs":[["Matt",1,3,1,16],["Luke",3,23,3,33],["Heb",7,14,7,14]]},{"text":"Achan. — Jos 7:18.","refs":[["Josh",7,18,7,18]]},{"text":"Elimelech. — Ru 1:1,2.","refs":[["Ruth",1,1,1,1],["Ruth",1,2,1,2]]},{"text":"Boaz. — Ru 2:1.","refs":[["Ruth",2,1,2,1]]},{"text":"Obed. — Ru 4:21.","refs":[["Ruth",4,21,4,21]]},{"text":"Jesse. — Ru 4:22; 1Sa 16:1.","refs":[["Ruth",4,22,4,22],["1Sam",16,1,16,1]]},{"text":"David. — 1Sa 16:1,13.","refs":[["1Sam",16,1,16,1],["1Sam",16,13,16,13]]},{"text":"Solomon. — 1Ki 1:32-39.","refs":[["1Kgs",1,32,1,39]]},{"text":"Elihu. — 1Ch 27:18.","refs":[["1Chr",27,18,27,18]]},{"text":"Pethahiah. — Ne 11:24.","refs":[["Neh",11,24,11,24]]},{"text":"Bezaleel. — Ex 31:2; 35:30.","refs":[["Exod",31,2,31,2],["Exod",35,30,35,30]]},{"text":"Nahshon. — Nu 7:12.","refs":[["Num",7,12,7,12]]},{"text":"Caleb. — Nu 14:24.","refs":[["Num",14,24,14,24]]},{"text":"Absalom. — 2Sa 15:1.","refs":[["2Sam",15,1,15,1]]},{"text":"Elhanan. — 2Sa 21:19; 23:24.","refs":[["2Sam",21,19,21,19],["2Sam",23,24,23,24]]},{"text":"Adonijah. — 1Ki 1:5,6.","refs":[["1Kgs",1,5,1,5],["1Kgs",1,6,1,6]]},{"text":"Jonathan. — 2Sa 21:21.","refs":[["2Sam",21,21,21,21]]}],"refCount":65}
